    "The site navigation, read by scripts/build_site_nav.py, which writes _sidebar.md, _navbar.md,",
    "the nested sidebars (guides/, disciplines/, tools/, ai-tooling/, mitre/), the domain hubs",
    "(hubs/), assets/site-nav.json (breadcrumbs) and the alias block in index.html.",
    "Targets are repository paths with a leading slash, as in the pages ('/' is the homepage).",
    "To move a reference to another hub, move its file name between 'docs' lists and run",
    "python scripts/build_site_nav.py. Every root reference must sit in exactly one hub; the",
    "--check run in CI fails otherwise, and fails when a hand-written page is in no nav section.",
    "A hub's 'home' links are the three shown on its card under 'Browse by domain' in HOME.md;",
    "each must be one of the hub's references or 'see_also' pages."
